# Cloudflare Pages redirects — real 301s, replacing the meta-refresh HTML stubs
# the GitHub Pages build had to use.
#
# NOTE: a static file always wins over a rule here, so the old
# public/goals.html etc. had to be deleted for these to fire.
#
/goals.html                      /personal/#goals                301
/KneePrehab.html                 /personal/#knee-prehab          301
/work/ycu.html                   /work/ycu/                      301
/work/pallet-detection.html      /work/pallet-detection/         301
/work/battery-cell-sorting.html  /work/battery-cell-sorting/     301
